# Local dev: fill these in by hand. Deployed on the shared VM: don't -- the podman secrets
# worldcup-football-data-token / worldcup-odds-api-key / worldcup-newsapi-key are canonical
# there, and `deploy/sync-env-from-secrets.sh` (re)generates this file from them. See
# README.md's Configuration section and the umbrella website/README.md's secrets section.
# football-data.org free API key (https://www.football-data.org/client/register)
FOOTBALL_DATA_TOKEN=
# The Odds API key (https://the-odds-api.com) for bookmaker odds / value betting (free 500/mo)
ODDS_API_KEY=
# Optional: override data/db locations
# WC_DATA_DIR=/path/to/worldcup-predictor/data
# WC_DB_PATH=/path/to/worldcup-predictor/data/worldcup.db
# Optional: NewsAPI developer key (https://newsapi.org) to supplement free RSS feeds.
# Not required; the system works on RSS alone.
NEWSAPI_KEY=
